# Exclude build artifacts, VCS, docs, and the frequently-edited docker build
# scripts from the image build context so that `COPY . ${ROS2_WS}/src/ros2-java/ros2_java`
# stays cache-stable across iterations of the Dockerfiles/build.sh.
# (The Dockerfile referenced by -f is always sent regardless of .dockerignore.)
#
# NOTE: keep docker/fetch_sources.py and docker/*.repos IN the context — they are
# used by explicit `COPY docker/...` lines and cannot be re-included once a parent
# dir is excluded, so we list only the volatile files explicitly.
output/
build.log
.git/
.github/
*.md

docker/Dockerfile.desktop
docker/Dockerfile.android
docker/build.sh
